              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Molly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good spinich dip to have with raw veggies. It is a little on the salty side, but not so much that I wouldn't make it again. I will just use a little less garlic salt next time. Also would add a little more hot sauce.",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-27T10:39:40.497Z"
